config BR2_PACKAGE_MINUI_LIST
	bool "minui-list"
	depends on BR2_PACKAGE_NEXTUI
	help
	  Scrollable list UI for NextUI/MinUI tool paks
	  (Artwork Scraper, Overlays, …).

	  Built from josegonzalez/minui-list (MIT, Jose Diaz-Gonzalez)
	  against Zlyme's NextUI SDK so fonts/assets come from
	  /usr/share/nextui/res. The linked NextUI objects stay
	  PolyForm Noncommercial 1.0.0 (originally MinUI by Shaun Inman).

	  https://github.com/josegonzalez/minui-list
	  NextUI: https://github.com/LoveRetro/NextUI
	  MinUI: https://github.com/shauninman/MinUI
